---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import { publicOperator } from '../lib/public-operator'
const subject = 'decod.ing sponsorship inquiry'
const body =
  'Hello, I would like to ask about the decod.ing sponsor space.\nProduct/site:\nDesired four-week period:\nAudience fit:\nPlease send the current measured audience and quotation.\nI understand this inquiry does not book or pay for a campaign.'
---

<Layout
  title="Sponsor a local developer workbench — decod.ing"
  description="One static, clearly labeled developer sponsor space, with no tracking or payload targeting."
>
  <article class="prose container">
    <span class="eyebrow">{publicOperator.name} · {publicOperator.koreanName}</span><h1>
      One place for a relevant developer tool.
    </h1><p>
      The sponsor space is below the first screen of a web tool. It never sits beside an input or
      decoded result. The installed app, workspace, CLI and extension remain ad-free.
    </p><h2>Price formula</h2><p>
      Weekly quote = the previous four weeks’ average weekly page views × USD 4 / 1,000, with a
      minimum of USD 25 per week. Campaigns run for four weeks. We share current measured traffic in
      the quotation; no audience figure is assumed here.
    </p><h2>Display rules</h2><p>
      Static, same-origin image and a link, labeled Sponsored. No tracking, cookies, payload
      targeting or third-party ad script. All decoder features remain free with no usage limit.
    </p><h2>How a campaign would run</h2><ol>
      <li>Inquiry and an audience-fit review.</li><li>
        A written quotation based on current measurements.
      </li><li>
        Only after sales and legal readiness: prepayment by bank transfer and an invoice.
      </li><li>Four weeks of clearly labeled display.</li>
    </ol><p class="notice">
      No campaign or payment is active. This page only opens an inquiry draft and does not reserve a
      space or charge you.
    </p><h2>Cancellation and refund</h2><p>
      Cancel with one email before the next cycle. Unserved time is refunded proportionally.
      Cancellation is no harder than making an inquiry.
    </p><a
      class="button"
      data-sponsor-interest
      href={`mailto:support@munops.com?subject=${encodeURIComponent(subject)}&body=${encodeURIComponent(body)}`}
      >Ask for the current audience and quote</a
    ><p>support@munops.com · <a href="/terms/">Terms</a> · <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a></p>
  </article>
</Layout>
<script>
  import { countOpen } from '../lib/telemetry'
  document
    .querySelector('[data-sponsor-interest]')
    ?.addEventListener('click', () => countOpen('sponsor_interest'))
</script>
